  "comments": "<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">Obverse</span><br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">1</span> - classic font, horizontal strokes thinner than vertical ones.<br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">2</span> - gothic font, strokes are thicker, in the word 원 (won) horizontal strokes of the same thickness as vertical ones.<br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">Reverse</span><br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">A</span> - numerals in 50 far from each other, the vertical lower right stroke in syllable 국 between beads.<br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">B</span> - numerals in 50 close to each other, the vertical lower right stroke in syllable 국 to a bead.<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/614c5b9b13e0b.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/614c5b9b13e0b.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"192\" height=\"250\" /></a><br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">Combinations</span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">1</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">A</span> 1983-1985, 1987-1989.<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">1</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">B</span> 1990-1997.<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">2</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">B</span> 1998-2019.",
